        },
        {
          "text": "Angelo mutaanzi wakalizya mweembo, lino kwakaba civulamabwe amulilo uuvwelene abulowa, zyakawisigwa ansi, nkabela mpawo cipanzi catatu canyika cakapya, acipanzi catatu camisamu cakapya, abwizu butete bwakapya boonse.",
