        {
          "text": "Lino angelo wabili wakalizya mweembo, elyo kwakawisigwa mulwizi cintu cili mbuli cilundu cipati ciyaka mulilo, nkabela cipanzi catatu calwizi cakasanduka kuba bulowa, ",
