        {
          "text": "Lino angelo watatu naakalizya mweembo, kwakawa inyenyeezi impati iizwa kujulu, yakali kuyaka mbuli ilampi, nkabela yakawida kucipanzi catatu camilonga akutusensa twamaanzi. ",
