        },
        {
          "text": "Izina lyanyenyeezi eyo litegwa Kabindaula, nkabela cipanzi catatu camaanzi cakaba akabindaula, aboobo bantu banjibanji bakafwa kumaanzi nkaambo akaluzigwa.",
